WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.860
It happened two years ago.

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:10.380
How I wish I could burn it from my memory.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:14.890
First year pa lang ako noon,

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.090
nung ma-inlove ako sa isang lalaki.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.820
Ako kasi, ayoko talaga sa mga pangit na babae.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.770
I can't stand

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:34.500
Why did you bite me?

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:35.600
What happened to you?

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.680
Why are you relaxing there?

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:38.400
I can feel it!

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.500
Aren't you the one who's making me nervous?

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.910
Now the weird girl will come, right?

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.240
Who are you?

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:45.750
Oh, right.

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:52.740
I just have a small favor for the four of you.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:53.340
It looks serious.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:54.800
That's right.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.280
My favorite girl is here and she will stay here.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:02:59.210
Really?

00:02:59.490 --> 00:02:59.970
You guys...

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.810
We'll go with him and after that...

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:07.810
I want you to help me make him a very handsome and beautiful man for his good.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.000
Are you serious? Why would we do that?

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:22.450
If you succeed in changing my name as a real man, I won't charge you rent here in my mansion.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:23.210
What?

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.290
Are you sure about that?

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.960
On one condition, if you don't succeed, I'll charge you...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.400
That's a triple!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:35.250
We're accepting him now.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:36.610
Good if that's the case.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.590
I don't understand anything anymore, so I'm leaving.

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.020
You're leaving?

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:41.620
What do you mean?

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:49.690
I have my own life, right?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.550
I need to be happy.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.440
This is a different kind of auntie.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.440
I'm traveling around the world.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:59.060
Maybe I'll find a man to marry.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.840
Adios, amigo!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:08.440
We're here? What are we going to do now?

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.060
You're too high, Vlad. Just think about it.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:15.460
You might forget that Loverboy Dalmaru is here.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:18.220
You're right, Yuki. I think I'll be an expert when I get there.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:23.750
I'm sure we won't be able to fool Auntie because of our good and handsome relationship.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:25.670
So you don't have to worry about anything.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.610
But we're going to eat here.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:27.750
What?

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.850
Because you don't know how to cook.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.660
You know that? Now that Aunty is back, we'll all be hungry here.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:34.540
Do you want that?

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.440
I can't be hungry!

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:39.400
That's why you're disappearing, Kehoe.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:40.340
You're a coward.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:43.460
You can't be a coward! Food is the most important thing in our lives!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:44.580
Shut up.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.730
I can't be quiet!

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:48.590
I hope you're hungry there.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:53.360
I know. It's better if we cut some flowers for my son.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.370
Yuki, can you help me?

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:59.720
Sure. Wait, someone's moving there.

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.460
Maybe it's just a cat.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:02.850
Let me see.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.720
Come here, Ning!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:05.300
Meow!

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:10.720
Yuki, what are you doing?

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.290
Wait a minute!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:27.880
What are you doing?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:28.240
You!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.740
He looks like a normal person.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.550
He doesn't look like a normal person.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:34.990
Take a good look.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.040
He has long hair that doesn't look like a shampoo.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.360
He wears a sweatshirt that doesn't look like he's fighting.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.020
He wears a long leather skirt.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.500
And his shoes don't look like they'll ever change.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:46.660
I hope we're just making a mistake.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:47.580
But...

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.400
Are you...

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:50.840
Are you Zonaco?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:51.320
Huh?

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:55.940
It looks like we're going to have a fight!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.700
Welcome, Zonaco.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.040
I'll take you to your room. Just follow me.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:14.840
Oh, by the way, all your things are in your room.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:19.440
I have a question.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.660
Aren't you having a hard time with your bangs?

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.020
Cut it.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.920
What did you say?

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:34.420
Don't you dare to look at me like that or you'll regret it!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.990
I can't take it anymore!

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:42.490
I'm so scared of you!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:45.070
I can't take it anymore!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:47.470
Get out of here!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:48.690
I won't let you!

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.380
I told you, this is what I'm going to do.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:01.490
What are we going to do now?

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.120
She's so different from what we expected.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:06.840
She looks like she's in horror movies.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:10.910
That's not all. She also looks like a girl who's always flirting.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:11.990
That's right.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:17.270
The other girl who's always flirting when we're smiling and she's like that.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.100
Good thing I didn't stop her because of my smile.

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:22.500
I think my smile is expensive that's why I'm saving it.

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:25.500
Stop that already.

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:27.840
Let's think about how to change her.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.740
That's right. Let's do what we can if...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.380
No, we're going to Lagot.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.900
Excuse me, what do you want?

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.770
A normal girl.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:47.500
I'll wait there.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:54.600
Bye girls, it's easy. We'll meet again.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.020
Really? You're such a playboy.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:03.440
I'm not bad, but I'm one of them.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.340
Hiroshi, why? Answer me.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.400
Why do I have to live in this kind of mansion?

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:18.140
Sunako, you might get hungry.

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.970
We brought you food.

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:22.050
Eat first, Sunako.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:46.420
You ask him yourself if he knows how to cook.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.760
I don't want to. He's scared to talk to me.

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:50.060
I thought you were scared.

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.390
It's hard for him to be like that.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.530
All my plans are ruined.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.590
Why is that?

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.690
I was planning to help him pack his things.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:18.170
Then, when I see a pink one, I'll tell him,

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.120
Sunako, you like pink.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.180
Then, he'll tell all the girls he likes pink.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:24.080
I'll tell him,

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.780
Do you want to kiss someone pink?

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:29.430
And we'll kiss until I touch his hand until...

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:29.870
Stop it!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.970
By the way, where is Chloe?

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:33.750
I don't know.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:35.250
Can I continue my story?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:35.830
Continue!

00:10:24.348 --> 00:10:24.588
sir

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.690
Who do you think I am?

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:35.420
I'm just forcing you to talk to me so we don't have to pay rent!

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.070
Rent?

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.630
Gagot, he said...

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:40.690
That's right!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.870
That's why we can't do anything but be with a weirdo like you!

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:46.080
And we're not going to enter your room!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:47.440
Scared?

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:48.060
Room?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.640
Tell me, are you afraid of men?

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:03.660
Huh?

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.430
Maybe you have a bad experience with men.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.350
Why are you wearing a t-shirt?

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:09.870
Be patient with us, Sunako.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:12.290
Next time, we'll be more careful with our clothes.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.050
You're wrong.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:15.690
Huh?

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:17.090
You just came out.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:18.660
Wait a minute.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.000
Sunako, that's true.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:21.260
Okay.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.580
If that's what you want, it's up to you.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.530
I don't know how handsome he is.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:43.120
It's so hard to live in a house with those men.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:52.340
What's wrong, Kyuhei? You're so weak.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:57.330
Yes, if Auntie finds out, we'll have to pay triple the rent.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.550
Wait, why am I the only one you're blaming?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:06.500
You're so selfish. I never thought there would be women like that in the world.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.220
It's weird. It's hard to be with.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:11.000
Are we going to give up and just pay rent?

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:14.250
Huh? Why?

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:17.370
What's that?

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:21.520
Oh, nothing. It's nothing.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:40.230
The streets are crowded.

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:41.270
The streets are crowded.

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:43.980
It's not good to go camping.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:45.260
What's up, Miss?

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:47.020
Do you need someone to go with you?

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:50.320
Huh?

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:55.420
It's easy.

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:56.660
What's that?

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.580
There's no place like this in the world.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:04.080
Why?

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:34.850
I'm going to kill you.

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.650
I'm going to kill you.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:15.030
Pa, because of what we said earlier, you're leaving all of a sudden?

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:15.880
You're so sensitive!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:32.930
Let's go!

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:35.320
Quick! I'm standing right here!

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:39.920
A woman shouldn't be coming out at this hour.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:44.100
Because they're in the movie, right?

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:45.340
The OA9!

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:46.060
Go home already!

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:51.910
Don't tell the three of you that I sent you here.

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:52.690
Is that clear?

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:55.340
Maybe later they'll think of something else.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:04.910
Oh no!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:08.400
Do you really know how to cook?

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:09.380
Let's just eat outside.

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:10.580
I don't have any money.

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:13.590
Let's just invite some girls.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:14.870
No, that's just extra food.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:16.330
Shut up!

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:17.930
I told you to leave it to me.

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:19.250
I can do this, okay?

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.090
You really can do this, huh?

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.090
He's even crying.

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:27.720
I thought, maybe even if he knows how to cook,

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.720
we still can't expect him to cook for us.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.880
Can't you just tell her first?

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:34.400
I'll get mad if I hear her name!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.010
You're right, Takinaga.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:42.030
Yuki, how can we talk to a person who's just sleeping in his dark room?

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:44.910
Yes, you're right. You have a point there.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.180
Hey! What is it? Are you still there?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.090
I don't want to talk to you!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:56.030
What's wrong with you?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.290
Are you hungry?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.100
Have you ever had a bad experience with men?

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.400
Next time, we'll be careful with our men.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.800
A woman shouldn't go out at this hour.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.170
Sit down.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:19.250
He's a cheater.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:21.880
Come on, who's going to lead the four of us?

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.800
I'm sure he's going to lead.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:29.020
I'm sorry, Karina. I've already sent you a message.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:35.500
Wait!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:38.520
It's good that you don't have your sapi anymore.

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:41.180
You're not ugly and it's good for you to cook.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.900
That's why we're going to be friends.

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.350
You scared us!

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.000
I thought we were going to be friends with our four brothers!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.020
You're so cute!

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:49.690
I can trust you!

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.470
If that's the case, can I see your face, Sweetie Pie?

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:52.810
No.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:53.710
No.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:59.450
Santamina, don't be hasty because we're not going to be friends again!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:02.480
Oh my God!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:03.360
You might get hurt.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:04.200
He's really aggressive.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:05.300
He really doesn't have mercy.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.980
You can see it in our faces.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.480
If not, we won't forgive you.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:09.920
Come on!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:13.720
If you're going to be quiet,

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:14.820
don't turn around.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:15.630
I'm going to pee!

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:19.200
That's why we're in the middle of an operation.

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:27.820
If you're going to be angry,

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.140
you're going to pee.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:34.340
Huh?

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.710
Did you see that?

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:07.570
Did you see that ugly face?

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.010
Look at that!

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:12.580
You don't have a face.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:13.880
You're so mean.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.510
I'm sorry, Suna.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:17.460
We didn't mean it.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:18.930
Don't cry.

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.130
You're not ugly.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:21.730
Stop crying!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:27.920
It's enough.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:30.680
SUDADO!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:54.420
His eyebrows are so thick!

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.590
His lips are so thick!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.130
His lips are almost cracked!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.560
His face is so...

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.810
Is that how girls are?

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.300
Of course not!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.140
We're in trouble, aren't we, Arina?

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:07.870
Let's just think about this.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.590
This is a challenge for us because she's not that ugly.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.200
Don't worry, we'll figure out a way.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:15.250
Me too.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:19.210
That's right, we can still get rid of those pimples on her face, right?

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:20.710
I'll take care of that.

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:26.640
A way to become a real man.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.100
If you have a problem because of a lot of pimples,

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:37.640
just make sure to wash your face and then apply the cleanser in the morning and at night.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:41.290
And remember, after you repeatedly apply the cleanser,

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:44.490
you need to follow it with a moisturizer while your face is still puffy.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:46.570
Oh!

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.480
That's wrong! Don't apply too much!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:52.910
And if there's a cleanser, there should also be a moisturizer.

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:54.950
Wait a minute, are you doing that?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.280
Of course!

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:05.440
Telephone.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:07.050
Telephone.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.570
Too much work to pick this up, huh?

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:12.050
Well, hello there.

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:13.510
ANTIE!

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:14.770
ANTIE!

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:18.220
Uh, oh, uh, well, uh, hello, Auntie dear.

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:18.560
Hmm?

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:26.140
You want to know how Sanako's doing?

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.620
She's changing into a wonderful lady of course.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:29.840
Sure.

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:31.070
just leave it to-

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:31.790
AAAAAAAAH!

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:33.810
She was even more suspicious than before!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.570
It's as if she's detached herself from all humanity!

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:40.130
We're supposed to make THAT into a lady?!

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:41.010
PANOPAU-

00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:48.080
And yet, there is a RUNCH!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.640
We have no choice!

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:54.530
We will change Sonako into the perfect lady!

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:56.790
We'll do it, or die trying!

00:22:00.796 --> 00:22:02.156
We gotta do it!

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:02.880
Yeah!

00:23:32.076 --> 00:23:33.276
What do we do? What do we do?

00:23:33.416 --> 00:23:35.276
Sanako's about to make her high school debut!

00:23:35.676 --> 00:23:37.056
Sanako, let's go to school!

00:23:37.116 --> 00:23:37.416
No!

00:23:37.536 --> 00:23:39.056
Sanako, put your uniform on!

00:23:39.076 --> 00:23:39.596
No, no!

00:23:39.736 --> 00:23:41.216
Sanako, pull up your bag!

00:23:41.216 --> 00:23:41.736
No, no, no!

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:44.140
Do you think you're in a no play or something?

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:46.620
Next time, pull down the iron curtain.

00:23:46.620 --> 00:23:47.620
Be sure to watch it!

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:49.620
No! Don't look!
